      "writtenOn": "2023-05-16T21:21:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it a PTS-tool problem, or is the ACL packet arriving out of order?\n\nShould we add a quirk that delays the first ACL packet from a connection?\n\nI don\u0027t really like delaying the packet for everyone if it\u0027s just for one host\u0027s convenience.",
      "revId": "3a6a324979ab6dc0777676da2e9754070a61ba2e",
