      "writtenOn": "2023-05-17T18:35:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s not exactly a quirk compared to what\u0027s listed already in the controller properties\u0027s ControllerQuirks field.\n\n- ControllerQuirks enables behaviors that would be forbidden by the specification\n\n- Here the issue is more likely caused by RootCanal not emulating the baseband and its inherent delays; I am guessing that this issue with the PTS test would not occur on physical devices. The workaround I am adding approximates the normal behaviour",
      "parentUuid": "2c24c7d8_9ea9d37e",
